{"id":"objetos.responsabilidades","number":"3.6","part":"objetos","kind":"leccion","title":[{"type":"text","text":"¿A quién le toca?"}],"minutes":30,"levels":["semilla","brote"],"needs":[{"id":"objetos.componer","number":"3.5","title":"Heredar o componer"}],"introduces":[{"id":"responsabilidad","label":"responsabilidad"},{"id":"tarjeta-de-responsabilidad","label":"tarjeta de responsabilidad"},{"id":"colaborador","label":"colaborador"}],"brief_problem":"La clase del kiosco que hace todo","previous":{"id":"objetos.componer","number":"3.5","title":"Heredar o componer"},"next":{"id":"objetos.proyecto","number":"P·III","title":"Proyecto: el kiosco con objetos"},"blocks":[{"type":"phrase","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Cada tarea le toca a la clase que tiene la información para hacerla."}]},{"type":"heading","id":"problema","number":"","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"El problema"}]},{"type":"problem","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Una sola pieza del kiosco, "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Kiosco","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":", lee las ventas, calcula los importes, descuenta el stock, aplica el descuento y escribe el ticket. Cada cambio, por chico que sea, toca esa pieza, y ya tiene "},{"type":"strong","text":"600 líneas"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"strong","text":"¿Cómo se reparte el trabajo?"}]}]},{"type":"heading","id":"intentalo","number":"","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Inténtalo"}]},{"type":"attempt","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Haz una lista de las tareas de "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Kiosco","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":" y escribe al lado qué dato necesita cada una para hacerse."}]}],"answer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Calcular un importe necesita el precio del producto. Descontar el stock necesita cuánto queda. Juntar el total y aplicar el descuento necesitan lo vendido. Escribir el ticket necesita las líneas de cada venta. Cada tarea necesita datos distintos: es la pista de que hay piezas distintas."}]}]},{"type":"cycle","phases":[1,2]},{"type":"phase_heading","id":"entender-planear","phases":[1,2],"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Entender y planear"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"entries":[[{"type":"strong","text":"¿Qué entra y qué sale?"},{"type":"text","text":" Lo mismo que antes: lo que cambia es quién hace cada parte."}],[{"type":"strong","text":"¿A qué se parece?"},{"type":"text","text":" A los módulos de "},{"type":"lesson_link","lesson":"procedimental.modulos","text":"la lección 2.7"},{"type":"text","text":": juntar lo que cambia por el mismo motivo."}],[{"type":"strong","text":"¿Quién tiene la información para hacer esto?"},{"type":"text","text":" Esa pregunta, hecha para cada tarea, reparte el trabajo."}]]},{"type":"figure","id":"ruta-tarjetas","number":"3.6-1","alt":"Las tarjetas del kiosco","description":"Cuatro tarjetas. Producto sabe su precio y calcula el importe. Inventario sabe el stock y quita si alcanza. Ticket anota e imprime las líneas. Caja registra la venta y junta el total, y le pide ayuda a las otras tres.","caption":[{"type":"text","text":"Cada tarjeta dice qué sabe o hace una clase y a quién le pide ayuda."}],"svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 230\" width=\"340\" height=\"230\"><title>Las tarjetas del kiosco</title><desc>Cuatro tarjetas. Producto sabe su precio y calcula el importe. Inventario sabe el stock y quita si alcanza. Ticket anota e imprime las líneas. Caja registra la venta y junta el total, y le pide ayuda a las otras tres.</desc><rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0005\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#FF0005\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"84\" y=\"30.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">Producto</text><text x=\"84\" y=\"45.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">sabe su precio</text><text x=\"84\" y=\"60.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">calcula el importe</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"6\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0005\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#FF0005\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"256\" y=\"30.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">Inventario</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"45.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">sabe el stock</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"60.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">quita si alcanza</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"150\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0005\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#FF0005\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"84\" y=\"174.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">Ticket</text><text x=\"84\" y=\"189.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">anota líneas</text><text x=\"84\" y=\"204.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">las imprime</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"150\" width=\"160\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0009\" fill-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke=\"#FF0009\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"256\" y=\"174.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">Caja</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"189.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">registra la venta</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"204.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">junta el total</text><polyline points=\"226,146 116.95,83.96\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF0001\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"110,80 119.18,80.04 114.73,87.87\" fill=\"#FF0001\"/><polyline points=\"256,146 256,88\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF0001\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"256,80 260.5,88 251.5,88\" fill=\"#FF0001\"/><polyline points=\"176,190 150,190 150,184\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF0001\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"150,176 154.5,184 145.5,184\" fill=\"#FF0001\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF000B\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\">la caja les pide ayuda</text></svg>","layers":[],"steps":[],"panels":[]},{"type":"heading","id":"herramienta","number":"","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"La herramienta nueva"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"No hay construcción nueva. Hay una forma de pensar. Una "},{"type":"definition","term":"responsabilidad","text":"responsabilidad"},{"type":"text","text":" es algo que una clase sabe o hace. Para hacerla, a veces le pide ayuda a otras: esas son sus "},{"type":"definition","term":"colaborador","text":"colaboradoras"},{"type":"text","text":". Una "},{"type":"definition","term":"tarjeta-de-responsabilidad","text":"tarjeta de responsabilidad"},{"type":"text","text":" anota, para cada clase, lo que le toca y con quién colabora, antes de escribir código."}]},{"type":"table","header":[[{"type":"text","text":"Clase"}],[{"type":"text","text":"Le toca"}],[{"type":"text","text":"Colabora con"}]],"rows":[[[{"type":"code","tokens":[["Producto","identifier"]]}],[{"type":"text","text":"saber su nombre y su precio; calcular el importe de una cantidad"}],[{"type":"text","text":"—"}]],[[{"type":"code","tokens":[["Inventario","identifier"]]}],[{"type":"text","text":"saber cuánto queda de cada producto; quitar si alcanza"}],[{"type":"text","text":"—"}]],[[{"type":"code","tokens":[["Ticket","identifier"]]}],[{"type":"text","text":"anotar líneas e imprimirlas"}],[{"type":"text","text":"—"}]],[[{"type":"code","tokens":[["Caja","identifier"]]}],[{"type":"text","text":"registrar una venta y juntar el total"}],[{"type":"code","tokens":[["Producto","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Inventario","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Ticket","identifier"]]}]]]},{"type":"cycle","phases":[3]},{"type":"phase_heading","id":"escribir","phases":[3],"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Escribir"}]},{"type":"program","id":"kiosco-repartido","title":"El kiosco repartido","source":"Class Producto\n  Define nombre As String;\n  Define precio As Integer;\n\n  Method Constructor(n As String, p As Integer)\n    This.nombre <- n;\n    This.precio <- p;\n  EndMethod\n\n  Method Importe(cantidad As Integer) As Integer\n    Return This.precio * cantidad;\n  EndMethod\nEndClass\n\nClass Inventario\n  Private Define stock As Dictionary<String, Integer>;\n\n  Method Constructor()\n    This.stock <- dictionary();\n  EndMethod\n\n  Method Cargar(nombre As String, cantidad As Integer)\n    This.stock[nombre] <- cantidad;\n  EndMethod\n\n  Method Quitar(nombre As String, cantidad As Integer) As Boolean\n    If cantidad > This.stock[nombre] Then\n      Return False;\n    EndIf\n    This.stock[nombre] <- This.stock[nombre] - cantidad;\n    Return True;\n  EndMethod\nEndClass\n\nClass Ticket\n  Private Define lineas As Vector<String>;\n\n  Method Constructor()\n    This.lineas <- vector();\n  EndMethod\n\n  Method Anotar(linea As String)\n    This.lineas.append(linea);\n  EndMethod\n\n  Method Imprimir()\n    For Each linea In This.lineas Do\n      Write linea;\n    EndFor\n  EndMethod\nEndClass\n\nClass Caja\n  Private Define total As Integer;\n\n  Method Constructor()\n    This.total <- 0;\n  EndMethod\n\n  Method Vender(producto As Producto, cantidad As Integer, inventario As Inventario, ticket As Ticket)\n    If inventario.Quitar(producto.nombre, cantidad) Then\n      This.total <- This.total + producto.Importe(cantidad);\n      ticket.Anotar(producto.nombre + \" x \" + toText(cantidad) + \" = \" + toText(producto.Importe(cantidad)));\n    Else\n      ticket.Anotar(producto.nombre + \" x \" + toText(cantidad) + \" rechazado\");\n    EndIf\n  EndMethod\n\n  Method Total() As Integer\n    Return This.total;\n  EndMethod\nEndClass\n\nAlgorithm Kiosco\n  Define jugo As Producto <- New Producto(\"Jugo\", 3);\n  Define sandwich As Producto <- New Producto(\"Sándwich\", 5);\n  Define inventario As Inventario <- New Inventario();\n  inventario.Cargar(\"Jugo\", 10);\n  inventario.Cargar(\"Sándwich\", 5);\n  Define ticket As Ticket <- New Ticket();\n  Define caja As Caja <- New Caja();\n  caja.Vender(jugo, 3, inventario, ticket);\n  caja.Vender(sandwich, 6, inventario, ticket);\n  caja.Vender(sandwich, 5, inventario, ticket);\n  ticket.Imprimir();\n  Write \"Total: \", caja.Total();\nEndAlgorithm\n","lines":[[["Class","keywordOop"],[" "],["Producto","identifier"]],[["  "],["Define","keywordStructured"],[" "],["nombre","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["String","type"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Define","keywordStructured"],[" "],["precio","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["Integer","type"],[";","punctuation"]],[],[["  "],["Method","keywordOop"],[" "],["Constructor","keywordOop"],["(","punctuation"],["n","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["String","type"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["p","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["Integer","type"],[")","punctuation"]],[["    "],["This","keywordOop"],[".","punctuation"],["nombre","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["n","identifier"],[";","punctuation"]],[["    "],["This","keywordOop"],[".","punctuation"],["precio","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["p","identifier"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["EndMethod","keywordOop"]],[],[["  "],["Method","keywordOop"],[" "],["Importe","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["cantidad","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["Integer","type"],[")","punctuation"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["Integer","type"]],[[" 